#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">This Odoo module <b>optimizes your logistics and "
"warehousing</b>,\n"
"                offering a complete solution to boost efficiency and "
"customer satisfaction across\n"
"                all services. It streamlines operations for everything from "
"long-term storage to\n"
"                pallet management and transport. You can effortlessly manage "
"client stock, schedule\n"
"                movements, ensure full traceability, optimize billing, and "
"provide customers with <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">real-time stock "
"visibility.</font></span>\n"
"            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">Este módulo de Odoo <b>optimiza tu logística y "
"almacenamiento</b>,\n"
"                ofreciendo una solución completa para impulsar la eficiencia "
"y la satisfacción del cliente en\n"
"                todos los servicios. Agiliza las operaciones para todo, "
"desde el almacenamiento a largo plazo hasta\n"
"                la gestión de palés y el transporte. Puedes gestionar sin "
"esfuerzo el stock de los clientes, programar\n"
"                movimientos, garantizar una trazabilidad completa, optimizar "
"la facturación y ofrecer a los clientes <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">"
"visibilidad del stock en tiempo real.</font></span>\n"
"            <br/>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
